openmediavault-pluginmgr (8.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * New 'Local deb' tab: upload .deb packages from the administrator's
    computer via the browser (pkgupload.php, same-origin OMV session
    authentication, files are stored in /tmp) and install them, or pick
    an existing .deb file from the /tmp directory of the system.
  * New RPC methods getLocalDebList/getLocalDebListBg/getLocalDebInfo/
    installLocalDeb for /tmp based package handling, including the
    'openmediavault' removal protection.
  * The former shared folder based installation form is still available
    on its own 'Shared folder' tab.
  * Uploaded files intentionally stay in /tmp and are cleaned up by the
    regular housekeeping of the temporary directory.
  * Fix the package details page not loading any data: the formPage route
    was missing 'editing: true', so the GET request was never issued.

 -- ${GITHUB_USER}  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800

openmediavault-pluginmgr (8.0.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix getPkgDetails: PHP exec() appends to the output array instead of
    clearing it; each command now uses its own output variable. This
    restores the installed version/status and hold detection on the
    package details page.

 -- ${GITHUB_USER}  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:30:00 +0800

openmediavault-pluginmgr (8.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Feature iteration inspired by OpenWrt's luci-app-package-manager:
    - Package details page (version, sizes, dependencies, description,
      repository origin/candidate, hold state).
    - Hold/unhold packages (apt-mark) with a new 'Hold' column in the
      installed list.
    - Purge packages (remove + delete configuration files).
    - Operation preview: show the 'apt-get --simulate' output in a task
      dialog before removing/installing.
    - Upgrade all packages and autoremove unneeded packages.
    - Install/remove/upgrade operations now show the raw apt output in
      a live task dialog.
  * Add Simplified Chinese (zh_CN) and Traditional Chinese (zh_TW)
    translation catalogs; the navigation entry and all web interface
    labels are translated when the system language is Chinese.

 -- ${GITHUB_USER}  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:00:00 +0800

openmediavault-pluginmgr (8.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: package manager plugin (installed/available/
    upgradable lists, install/remove via background tasks, local
    .deb installation from a shared folder, openmediavault*
    removal protection).
  * Version scheme: major version follows the OpenMediaVault major
    version (OMV 8.x -> plugin 8.x.y).

 -- ${GITHUB_USER}  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 05:00:00 +0800
